==Description==
The '''Null Medic''', internally referred to as '''Corrupted Medic''', was a support enemy that appeared in [[Banlands]] and [[Blind Faith]] as part of the [[Null & Void Event]]. It had a decent amount of health and an above average speed. While it was using its ability, it also gained 100% [[Defense]], effectively doubling its health against most damage sources.

It had one ability, ''Corrupted Heal'', where it stopped moving which gave it a [[Defense]] of 100%. While standing still, it will begin to heal enemies, including itself, by 150 health every 0.2 seconds for 6 seconds.

