==Appearance==
The '''Null Medic''' is a corrupted recreation of the [[Medic]]. It has dark purple skin and white hair. It wears a purple coat, grey shoes, purple gloves and torn purple pants. It has purple goo covering its right arm, which on some spots has neon pink balls and blue spikes. It holds a medi gun, which it uses to heal itself and other enemies.

